"""
Sample-Corpus Civic Search Agent
================================

A reusable retrieval-and-extractive-synthesis layer for public-record corpora.

Pipeline
--------
question
    -> sentence-transformer query embedding
    -> FAISS semantic retrieval
    -> intent-aware reranking
    -> source-diverse evidence selection
    -> deterministic extractive synthesis
    -> clickable author-date citations
    -> optional query log

This version does not use an LLM API.

Expected index directory
------------------------
The index directory must contain:
    chunks.jsonl 
    faiss.index
    both from(build_retrieval_index.py)

The chunk records should include, at minimum:
    chunk_text
    document_id
    V04_Title
    V13_SourceLink

Optional metadata fields improve ranking/citations:
    normalized_date
    V01_Date
    section_name
    V06_PolicyStage
    V07_EventType
    V10_SourceClass
    V11_BodyClass
    V16_Tier

Install dependencies
--------------------
    pip install faiss-cpu sentence-transformers numpy

Example
-------
    python civic_search_agent.py \
        --index-dir ./retrieval_index \
        --question "How has this project developed over time?"

Run without --question for interactive mode.
"""

